---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="content-grid">
    <Panel title="About this site">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Tyler NFL is a one person analytics site. The centerpiece is the
          <a href={url('fourth-down')}>4th down calculator</a>, which compares going for it, kicking
          and punting by win probability; around it are stat leaders, standings and playoff odds, a
          daily history note, and the occasional <a href={url('articles')}>article</a> about what the
          numbers say.
        </p>
        <p>
          The calculator runs Ben Baldwin's <a href="https://github.com/nflverse/nfl4th">nfl4th</a>
          model, reproduced exactly and released under the
          <a href="https://github.com/nflverse/nfl4th/blob/master/LICENSE">MIT license</a>. It is not
          yet adjusted for the teams playing. A running record of graded calls is planned: each time
          a coach's choice gave up win probability, by how much.
        </p>
        <p>Data comes from the nflverse project.</p>
      </div>
    </Panel>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
